1
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:06,030
Dad, I agree to get married.

2
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:30,950
Seventh Uncle, you really want
to get married that much?

3
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:31,650
You...

4
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:54,210
Not enough force.

5
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,010
You need more practice.

6
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:58,410
Do you know what you're doing?

7
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,610
I'm your uncle.

8
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:00,780
What you're doing is...

9
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:02,580
Incestuous and immoral.

10
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:05,050
What else?

11
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:08,820
It's only because you're my uncle

12
00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:11,700
that it stopped here.

13
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,700
Otherwise...

14
00:01:23,110 --> 00:01:24,910
Don't even think about leaving,

15
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:27,150
or I'll definitely go further.

16
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:30,650
I know

17
00:01:31,190 --> 00:01:32,720
it was you who convinced my dad back then

18
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:34,560
to let me go to medical school.

19
00:01:35,030 --> 00:01:36,590
Is this why you said the condition
was for me

20
00:01:36,590 --> 00:01:37,920
to move into your house?

21
00:01:38,630 --> 00:01:39,530
So what if it is?

22
00:01:40,660 --> 00:01:41,660
You really are...

23
00:01:42,870 --> 00:01:47,350
Disgusting, a bastard, and a psycho?

24
00:01:49,270 --> 00:01:51,400
As long as you dare to say it, I'll do it.

25
00:01:52,460 --> 00:01:54,430
I promise I won't let you down.

26
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:01,470
You should be glad
we're not at home right now.

27
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,020
Let me go.

28
00:02:07,630 --> 00:02:09,560
I'll leave and be far away from you.

29
00:02:12,250 --> 00:02:13,660
Go ahead and try.

30
00:02:14,550 --> 00:02:16,610
Let's see if you will escape in the end

31
00:02:18,030 --> 00:02:19,500
or if I will keep you.

32
00:02:22,190 --> 00:02:23,560
Why me?

33
00:02:31,230 --> 00:02:32,460
You owe me.

34
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,020
You've owed me since way back.

35
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:07,630
[Shinji: Double Shuffle] [Episode 2]

36
00:04:08,620 --> 00:04:11,990
[Pan-Asia Group
Current Situation Analysis]

37
00:04:17,850 --> 00:04:18,620
Sir,

38
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,570
if there are any omissions,

39
00:04:20,589 --> 00:04:22,450
I will correct them immediately.

40
00:04:26,330 --> 00:04:27,200
Very well.

41
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,220
Since

42
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:30,670
you proposed the Global Mart merger,

43
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:33,290
I'll leave it in your hands.

44
00:04:34,130 --> 00:04:35,060
Really?

45
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:39,970
With the Global Mart channel,

46
00:04:41,180 --> 00:04:42,990
our Pan-Asia will essentially cover

47
00:04:42,990 --> 00:04:46,790
convenience stores, supermarkets,
and hypermarkets,

48
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:51,340
becoming the industry leader
across these three major retail channels.

49
00:04:53,110 --> 00:04:54,850
And we can show the young people

50
00:04:55,550 --> 00:04:57,350
what a real merger is.

51
00:05:00,290 --> 00:05:01,220
30 billion.

52
00:05:02,620 --> 00:05:04,390
Acquire it for 30 billion.

53
00:05:04,410 --> 00:05:05,440
Thank you, Dad!

54
00:05:05,810 --> 00:05:07,720
No, I mean thank you, Chairman.

55
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:09,220
I'll do my best.

56
00:05:09,420 --> 00:05:10,230
Ruichen,

57
00:05:11,430 --> 00:05:14,560
Being the confirmed successor
doesn't mean things won't change.

58
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,890
The business world is like a battlefield.

59
00:05:16,930 --> 00:05:19,060
Strength is the most important thing.

60
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,750
Yes, Chairman.

61
00:05:35,159 --> 00:05:36,830
Grandpa is too ruthless.

62
00:05:37,470 --> 00:05:39,330
He just announced the succession,

63
00:05:39,330 --> 00:05:41,590
and now he's giving you this kind of test.

64
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,940
If Third Uncle really manages

65
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:45,240
to acquire Global Mart for 30 billion,

66
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,370
you'll be in danger.

67
00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:49,680
Should we go to the temple and pray

68
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:52,150
that the gods will make Third Uncle fail?

69
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:54,360
I hope he succeeds.

70
00:05:55,530 --> 00:05:56,850
Are you kidding me?

71
00:05:57,170 --> 00:05:58,170
What do you think?

72
00:05:59,420 --> 00:06:02,480
It's very immoral
to answer a question with a question.

73
00:06:02,660 --> 00:06:03,920
Once you figure it out,

74
00:06:04,190 --> 00:06:08,050
you'll be one step closer to being
the Chairman's special assistant.

75
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:13,720
If Third Uncle really manages...

76
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,000
Don't follow me.

77
00:06:19,670 --> 00:06:21,540
Another secret itinerary?

78
00:06:21,630 --> 00:06:23,490
Why are you always so mysterious?

79
00:06:29,270 --> 00:06:31,440
What's so great about skyscrapers?

80
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,220
We might as well go camping.

81
00:06:33,610 --> 00:06:37,490
Seeing the mountains, the sea,
and the animals—

82
00:06:37,690 --> 00:06:38,950
how nice would that be!

83
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:46,110
I want to go camping.

84
00:06:46,140 --> 00:06:47,220
Get ready.

85
00:06:51,810 --> 00:06:52,880
That's not right.

86
00:06:52,930 --> 00:06:55,460
There are no surveillance cameras
or drones.

87
00:06:55,550 --> 00:06:57,120
How did she know?

88
00:07:08,380 --> 00:07:10,580
Senior, I bought it for you.

89
00:07:11,620 --> 00:07:12,380
Thanks.

90
00:07:13,460 --> 00:07:14,720
I'll help you apply it.

91
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,100
Thank you.

92
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,270
Here?

93
00:07:19,290 --> 00:07:20,120
Right.

94
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:26,060
You look very tired today.

95
00:07:27,050 --> 00:07:29,310
I haven't slept well these past few days.

96
00:07:29,340 --> 00:07:30,040
Why?

97
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,060
Too much pressure at work?

98
00:07:33,130 --> 00:07:34,530
How should I put it?

99
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:38,170
I've been fending off a creep at home
every night.

100
00:07:53,980 --> 00:07:55,110
If you keep doing it,

101
00:07:55,830 --> 00:07:57,159
I'll tear the door down.

102
00:08:26,380 --> 00:08:27,290
Weixia.

103
00:08:28,460 --> 00:08:30,120
Zherui, what brings you here?

104
00:08:32,190 --> 00:08:33,120
You're injured.

105
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,220
Do me a favor.

106
00:08:34,450 --> 00:08:35,490
Dr. Fan,

107
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:38,440
the blood sugar of the patient in bed 206C
has dropped again.

108
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,580
Okay, got it.

109
00:08:40,179 --> 00:08:40,980
Wait a moment.

110
00:08:41,340 --> 00:08:42,919
Zongyi, apply some medicine for him.

111
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:43,419
Okay.

112
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:46,000
I'll be right back.

113
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:50,140
Come on, this way please.

114
00:08:52,060 --> 00:08:53,160
Thank you.

115
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:02,170
I'm sorry.

116
00:09:02,970 --> 00:09:04,500
I know it's meaningless to say this,

117
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:05,170
but...

118
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:09,610
I really didn't know
he would force this marriage on you.

119
00:09:09,610 --> 00:09:10,500
It's fine.

120
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,350
If it weren't the Zhang family,

121
00:09:12,350 --> 00:09:14,150
it would be the Fang or Li family.

122
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:15,880
It's only a matter of time.

123
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:17,920
Instead, I should thank you

124
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,720
for making me realize the truth.

125
00:09:20,420 --> 00:09:21,220
Thank me?

126
00:09:21,460 --> 00:09:23,220
I originally thought that if my dad
had agreed to let me study medicine

127
00:09:23,220 --> 00:09:24,230
instead of joining Pan-Asia,

128
00:09:24,230 --> 00:09:26,090
none of this would have happened.

129
00:09:26,590 --> 00:09:27,730
I was too naive.

130
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:30,560
Is there no way for you to refuse?

131
00:09:31,370 --> 00:09:32,970
I agreed to it myself.

132
00:09:34,310 --> 00:09:35,840
I need this marriage

133
00:09:35,870 --> 00:09:37,670
to show my value and repay my dad,

134
00:09:38,170 --> 00:09:40,230
and it also gives me a reason to leave.

135
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:49,940
Don't take it to heart.

136
00:09:50,650 --> 00:09:52,110
I have my own purposes too.

137
00:09:56,220 --> 00:09:57,330
No matter what,

138
00:09:57,830 --> 00:09:58,630
thank you.

139
00:09:59,260 --> 00:10:00,700
I owe you a favor.

140
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,630
If you ever need me in the future,

141
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:03,630
just ask.

142
00:10:07,970 --> 00:10:08,980
You owe me.

143
00:10:10,130 --> 00:10:11,800
You've owed me for a long time.

144
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,450
Are you okay?

145
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:24,130
I'm fine.
My tongue is just sensitive to heat.

146
00:10:24,250 --> 00:10:25,280
Just like me.

147
00:10:28,260 --> 00:10:31,630
What exactly... do I owe him?

148
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:42,660
Wenfei.

149
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:46,400
Time flies.

150
00:10:48,300 --> 00:10:51,330
You've been gone for 15 years.

151
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:08,370
Wenfei!

152
00:11:12,830 --> 00:11:15,130
Your son is about to get justice for you.

153
00:11:16,630 --> 00:11:17,780
Rest assured.

154
00:11:19,070 --> 00:11:20,410
I will help him.

155
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:24,170
Just wait and see those

156
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:28,030
who harmed and insulted you

157
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:30,810
meet a terrible end.

158
00:11:54,140 --> 00:11:55,970
That old fox Fan Hongda announced

159
00:11:55,970 --> 00:11:57,900
that you'll succeed him in 3 years.

160
00:11:58,380 --> 00:11:59,380
What do you think?

161
00:12:00,110 --> 00:12:01,240
He's using me as bait

162
00:12:01,470 --> 00:12:03,740
to see which of his sons is still useful.

163
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:07,250
This morning he told Fan Jiahong

164
00:12:07,250 --> 00:12:09,850
to take charge of
the Global Mart acquisition.

165
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:11,240
You're quite rational.

166
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:14,630
You didn't let the succession
cloud your judgment.

167
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:17,590
Next, the Fan family will probably
form a secret alliance against you.

168
00:12:17,590 --> 00:12:18,920
What are you going to do?

169
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:22,240
It's a good opportunity
to solve it all at once.

170
00:12:26,340 --> 00:12:28,310
Have New Future join the acquisition

171
00:12:28,310 --> 00:12:29,680
and bid 36 billion.

172
00:12:30,780 --> 00:12:32,780
You plan to use New Future

173
00:12:32,780 --> 00:12:34,780
to raise Global Mart's price?

174
00:12:35,420 --> 00:12:36,220
Give me a reason.

175
00:12:36,220 --> 00:12:40,280
To find out the whereabouts of the funds
Fan Jiahong moved from Pan-Asia.

176
00:12:40,590 --> 00:12:42,020
Pan-Asia bid 30 billion.

177
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,860
He has to prove his ability.

178
00:12:45,420 --> 00:12:47,930
Once he uses the secret funds,

179
00:12:47,950 --> 00:12:49,390
there will be traces.

180
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:51,680
Tracing them back to the source,

181
00:12:51,880 --> 00:12:54,340
we'll expose his embezzlement
of public funds.

182
00:12:54,340 --> 00:12:57,780
Money never flows toward opportunities;

183
00:13:00,030 --> 00:13:01,490
it flows toward ambition.

184
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:06,860
Once this is exposed,

185
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:09,600
he'll have no place

186
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:12,600
in Pan-Asia or the Fan family.

187
00:13:13,950 --> 00:13:15,690
With your scheming mind,

188
00:13:17,510 --> 00:13:19,340
no wonder you took back
all of Wenfei's inheritance

189
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:21,150
from me when you were 22.

190
00:13:21,530 --> 00:13:22,730
As long as you want it,

191
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,980
there's nothing you can't do.

192
00:13:29,020 --> 00:13:30,320
I wish that were true.

193
00:13:35,140 --> 00:13:36,180
How long do you plan to let Fan Weixia

194
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:37,680
stay at your place?

195
00:13:38,810 --> 00:13:39,710
Don't touch him.

196
00:13:39,710 --> 00:13:41,080
That's Wenfei's house.

197
00:13:41,710 --> 00:13:44,540
I've let a Fan stay there long enough.

198
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:46,290
I've shown you enough respect.

199
00:13:46,710 --> 00:13:48,650
I know why you keep him around.

200
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:52,600
As long as he doesn't affect the plan,
do as you please.

201
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:53,730
However,

202
00:13:53,750 --> 00:13:55,690
if he becomes a stumbling block,

203
00:13:58,530 --> 00:13:59,570
I won't hold back.

204
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:32,160
I haven't said you can leave.

205
00:14:33,930 --> 00:14:36,220
My dad wants me to move back to the old house
to prepare for the engagement.

206
00:14:36,220 --> 00:14:38,750
He'll send people
to move my things tomorrow.

207
00:14:44,180 --> 00:14:46,610
Do you think bringing up Grandpa

208
00:14:47,370 --> 00:14:48,370
will scare me?

209
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:08,130
Are you okay?

210
00:15:11,970 --> 00:15:14,100
Seems you couldn't wait to be under me,

211
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:17,300
so you created an opportunity on purpose.

212
00:15:17,300 --> 00:15:18,350
I did not.

213
00:15:23,130 --> 00:15:24,330
You crazy...

214
00:15:24,450 --> 00:15:28,900
Disgusting, a bastard, and a psycho?

215
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:31,410
As long as you dare to say it, I'll do it.

216
00:15:32,620 --> 00:15:34,360
I promise I won't let you down.

217
00:15:35,750 --> 00:15:39,210
Say it. I'll wait for you to finish
before I start.

218
00:15:52,950 --> 00:15:54,280
If you want to reject me,

219
00:15:55,210 --> 00:15:57,010
you shouldn't leave any leeway.

220
00:15:58,350 --> 00:16:01,160
Being kind to the enemy
is being cruel to yourself.

221
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:04,420
Remember that.

222
00:16:15,910 --> 00:16:16,940
Ward rounds start now.

223
00:16:16,940 --> 00:16:18,310
Ask if you have any questions.

224
00:16:18,310 --> 00:16:19,040
Okay.

225
00:16:19,510 --> 00:16:20,450
Zongyi.

226
00:16:21,790 --> 00:16:23,610
Good morning. How are you feeling today?

227
00:16:23,610 --> 00:16:25,210
Are you feeling a bit better?

228
00:16:25,220 --> 00:16:26,950
I'm still a bit short of breath.

229
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:29,090
Okay, let me check.

230
00:16:44,500 --> 00:16:46,260
Looks like the inflammation
hasn't subsided yet.

231
00:16:46,260 --> 00:16:47,370
Plus, there's still phlegm.

232
00:16:47,370 --> 00:16:48,690
Being a bit short of breath is normal.

233
00:16:48,690 --> 00:16:50,860
Let's keep observing for a little longer.

234
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:52,350
Record it and keep an eye on it.

235
00:16:52,350 --> 00:16:53,350
Yes, Senior.

236
00:16:53,970 --> 00:16:54,940
Oh my.

237
00:16:54,970 --> 00:16:58,170
Our boss's daughter got busted
for throwing a drug party.

238
00:16:58,190 --> 00:17:00,390
Are you talking about Zhang Yuhua,

239
00:17:00,850 --> 00:17:03,860
his youngest daughter, who always comes
to the office to throw her weight around?

240
00:17:03,860 --> 00:17:07,599
Yes, I said that she'd get into trouble
if she kept acting like that.

241
00:17:08,579 --> 00:17:10,310
Yeah, look.

242
00:17:11,460 --> 00:17:13,160
Can I borrow your phone to read the news?

243
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:13,950
Sure.

244
00:17:14,890 --> 00:17:15,790
Thanks.

245
00:17:16,190 --> 00:17:18,660
Karma comes so fast.

246
00:17:17,599 --> 00:17:20,190
[High-Society Party Turns Into Drug Party,
Names of Powerful Families' Children Exposed]

247
00:17:18,770 --> 00:17:20,300
I heard the boss was going to

248
00:17:20,329 --> 00:17:24,060
arrange a marriage alliance
with the Fan family of Pan-Asia Group.

249
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:26,240
Senior,

250
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:28,200
the patient in bed 206C is missing!

251
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,380
Mr. Li!

252
00:17:46,370 --> 00:17:47,470
Mr. Li!

253
00:18:03,370 --> 00:18:04,150
Mr. Li!

254
00:18:10,890 --> 00:18:11,890
Mr. Li, watch out!

255
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:21,900
Why are you here?

256
00:18:21,930 --> 00:18:24,730
Don't throw your life away
for irrelevant people.

257
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:26,360
He is my patient.

258
00:18:26,770 --> 00:18:27,900
Your life is mine.

259
00:18:30,630 --> 00:18:31,770
Nonsense.

260
00:18:34,530 --> 00:18:35,190
Mr. Li.

261
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:38,350
Mr. Li.

262
00:18:40,050 --> 00:18:41,180
Are you hurt?

263
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:43,400
Are you okay?

264
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:46,180
Come on. Let me help you back.

265
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:48,870
Walk slowly.

266
00:18:51,090 --> 00:18:51,820
This way.

267
00:18:59,550 --> 00:19:02,590
Well... come with me.

268
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:19,760
Lift your hand.

269
00:19:42,300 --> 00:19:43,120
I'll handle this.

270
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:44,520
Can you go take care of Mr. Li for me?

271
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:45,290
Okay.

272
00:19:52,010 --> 00:19:53,440
Hurry up. My hand hurts.

273
00:20:13,560 --> 00:20:14,560
You came to see me?

274
00:20:17,630 --> 00:20:19,590
I have good news and bad news.

275
00:20:20,890 --> 00:20:22,820
Which one do you want to hear first?

276
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:25,210
Is it about Zhang Yuhua?

277
00:20:27,050 --> 00:20:28,650
Looks like you already know.

278
00:20:29,230 --> 00:20:31,630
The good news
is you saw a woman's true colors.

279
00:20:31,630 --> 00:20:32,760
The bad news

280
